  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Grate zucchini.\n• Pour boiling water into a large saucepan over high heat. Add a pinch of salt, then bring to the boil. Cook fettuccine in boiling water until ‘al dente’, 9 minutes.\n• Reserve some pasta water (2 tbs for 2 people / 1/4 cup for 4 people), then drain pasta and return to saucepan. Drizzle with olive oil. TIP: ‘Al dente’ pasta is cooked through but still slightly firm in the centre.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-675959dab3cc8de1f221c92e-b83d09fe.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat.\n• Cook snacking tomatoes and zucchini, stirring occasionally, until blistered, 4-5 minutes. Transfer to a small bowl",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-675959dab3cc8de1f221c92e-d5429e1c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook garlic paste until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Stir in light cooking cream and vegetable stock pot and cook until slightly thickened, 1-2 minutes.\n• Stir in basil pesto, a pinch of chilli flakes (if using), cooked fettuccine and reserved pasta water until heated through.\n• Remove pan from heat then stir in zucchini and blistered tomatoes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-675959dab3cc8de1f221c92e-bae7fe9a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a large bowl, combine mixed salad leaves, mustard cider dressing and a drizzle of olive oil. Season.\n• Divide pesto and cherry tomato fasta-pasta between bowls.\n• Sprinkle with Parmesan cheese.\n• Serve with mustard cider salad. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-675959dab3cc8de1f221c92e-cacc2960.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
